tes as\n\n$$\n\\Delta=\\{(r,\\theta):0\\le r\\le 5,\\ 0\\le\\theta\\le \\frac{\\pi}{2}\\}.\n$$\n\nThe change of variables formula for plane polar coordinates states that\n\n$$\n\\iint_D f(x,y)\\,dA=\\iint_\\Delta f(r\\cos\\theta,r\\sin\\theta)\\,r\\,dr\\,d\\theta.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write our double integral as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\iint_D\\left(3\\right)\\,dA&=\\iint_\\Delta\\left(3\\right)r\\,dr\\,d\\theta\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\int_{0}^{5}3 r\\,dr\\,d\\theta.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519834 1080 "\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\int_{0}^{3}r\\,dr\\,d\\theta" 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519834 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519834 1083 #uuid "ec51caf8-2b6b-5744-bff0-e4556b7398b6" 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519835 1080 "\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\int_{0}^{6}-2\\,dr\\,d\\theta" 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519835 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519835 1083 #uuid "f1080001-7044-5cae-8c5e-ca6c9563b93b" 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519836 1080 "\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\int_{0}^{4}r^{2} \\left(r \\sin{\\left(2 \\theta \\right)} + 12 r \\cos{\\left(2 \\theta \\right)} + 2 \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)}\\right)\\,dr\\,d\\theta" 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519836 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519836 1083 #uuid "f2b919e8-c51c-5645-a044-fa4020014251" 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519837 1080 "\\int_{0}^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\int_{0}^{6}r \\left(3 r^{2} \\sin{\\left(2 \\theta \\right)} + 9 r^{2} + 3 r \\sin{\\left(\\theta \\right)} - 2 \\cos{\\left(r \\cos{\\left(\\theta \\right)} \\right)}\\right)\\,dr\\,d\\theta" 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519837 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535585 17592186045443 true] [17592186519837 1083 #uuid "f79cb302-5362-5bd3-b93a-451fdc8f9345" 1